    "detailed_description": "CodeWalker\u2122 is a developer tool that shows you how your source code fits together, how it's structured, and how it executes. It lets you instantly compare complex structures, find unintentional recursion, and visually see how your code actually works.<br />\r\nIt features 2D and 3D graphical interfaces that allow a programmer to quickly understand, debug, and optimize software. <br />\r\n\u200b<br />\r\nCodeWalker\u2122 can currently understand the following languages. <br />\r\nC<br />\r\nC++<br />\r\nC#<br />\r\nJava<br />\r\nPython<br />\r\nPython-formatted pseudo code<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe have more language support on the way!",
