    "short_description": "CodeWalker\u2122 is a developer tool that shows you how your source code fits together, how it's structured, and how it executes. instantly compare complex structures, find unintentional recursion, and just see how your code actually works, in 2D and 3D modes. It's like GPS for your code.",
